finding("AXIOM-ID-COLLISION-SCOPE-2026-08-03") {

  summary: "Full-repo grep audit (GNU grep, WSL, whole tree: docs/, projects/*/src/,
      scripts/, opsroom/, api/, cli/, core/, ROADMAP/TASKS/HANDOFF) of bare
      axiom-ID-shaped labels 'A[0-9]{1,2}(\\.[0-9])?' and 'D[0-9]{1,2}[a-z]?' as
      standalone tokens (comments, doc prose, module headers, rule() calls).
      Result: FIVE distinguishable A/D-schemes coexist. THREE new real
      collisions found beyond the two already known (A0, A4), including one
      INTERNAL canon collision (A12) never surfaced by the 2-file check.
      Complete rename change-list proposed, NOT applied."

